direction: down
classes: {
  start: {style: {fill: "#17334b"; font-color: white; bold: true}}
}
start: Start here\nDeclare body run / side and independent geometry group {class: start}
sequence: Confirm side sequence\nBlanks advance / explicit repeats do not\nChapter group keeps run side / reanchor breaks
reference: Choose reference page or pair\nMark top and inner content anchors
canvas: Common canvas and target guides\nWhite padding / visible paper-size growth
left_page: Left-page placement\nInner edge towards binding on right
right_page: Right-page placement\nInner edge towards binding on left
shift: Translation + padding\nPreserve each page's scale\nNever mirror page images
check: Full / native / pair / group preview\nAll retained content fits? {shape: diamond}
resize: Enlarge target or reject proposal\nUnpositioned member retains own canvas unresolved\nA crop needs its own acceptance
accept: Accept group or individual placement\nDefault page order unchanged
start -> sequence: "1. assign, never infer from PDF ordinal"
sequence -> reference: "2. choose layout evidence"
reference -> canvas: "3. target top + mirrored binding margins"
canvas -> left_page
canvas -> right_page
left_page -> shift
right_page -> shift
shift -> check: "4. preview"
check -> accept: "5. content retained"
check -> resize: clipping / uncertainty
